Every image this catalogue publishes is built with Docker Hardened Images
tooling and packages and contains DHI-origin content: the dhi.io/build
frontend produces it, dhi.io builder images compile it, and its base layers
come from the dhi.io apk package repositories (the public "main" lines only)
and their signing keyring. No definition in this repository is a copy of a
catalog definition; each was authored here. A definition copied or adapted
from the catalog carries a modification notice (docs/CONVENTIONS.md,
Definitions).

Third-party packages and binaries inside every published image remain under
their own upstream licences, enumerated per package in the SPDX and
CycloneDX SBOMs attested to each platform manifest:

  cosign verify-attestation --type spdxjson  <image>@sha256:<digest>
  cosign verify-attestation --type cyclonedx <image>@sha256:<digest>

with the identities README.md ("Verify an image") names. Each definition's
license: field names the licence of the upstream software it repackages.

Measured 2026-09-07 with crane export: the published runtime images carry no
licence text in their filesystem (hardened-app 0.1.1: 68 files, valkey 9.1.2:
101 files, none named LICENSE or NOTICE; grafana 13.1.5 ships its upstream's
own LICENSE and NOTICE.md). This repository, which owns the registry
